  "projectName": "Meridian",
  "projectDescription": "A local-first ambient automation daemon that reads screenpipe's activity recordings, structures them into app sessions, classifies each session by task and category, and automatically syncs time and context to Jira, GitHub Issues, and Linear — with zero manual input.",
